    "Diagnose the WI-0112 Token stop offline, preserve detailed usage telemetry, account for interrupted filesystem changes, and make recoverable candidate failures continue without repeated human approval while preserving fail-closed exceptions."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "Every usage update durably records input, cached-input, output, reasoning-output, and total Tokens when supplied by the Provider.",
    "Interrupted turns measure and retain Git-visible changed paths and disk growth instead of reporting a misleading zero.",
    "A recoverable candidate stop is isolated and later candidates continue automatically; protocol drift, unapproved spend, external writes, policy changes, and unsafe scope violations still stop the program.",
